{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter <i>Hellmarch</i> \u2014 a world consumed by nightmares, ancient ruins, forbidden magic, and mountains of loot. Battle relentless enemy hordes, grow stronger with every run, and uncover the dark secrets of a forgotten land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Salvage gear into crafting materials and upgrade your loadout with dozens of unique recipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AAA visuals powered by Unity Engine 6 \u2014 dark, detailed, and D4-inspired.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Massive enemy cap: now supports up to <strong>8192</strong> foes (doubled from <i>Malignant Survivors 1</i>).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore <strong>10+ diverse maps</strong>, each with its own deadly challenges.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647190?t=1744891118","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647190?t=1744891118","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/46908f1e5a06d9c559b5f1f59e16d77bebd0200c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744891118","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/46908f1e5a06d9c559b5f1f59e16d77bebd0200c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744891118","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter <i>Hellmarch</i> \u2014 a world consumed by nightmares, ancient ruins, forbidden magic, and mountains of l